Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD completion-decision controller coverage to lock
 review-finished chat behavior

The controller tests cover the clean-review completion path end to end: review completion selects the patch chat, yes closes the feature, and a later user message reopens the chat before sending follow-up work.
